      "content": "it's hard to believe that. it feels more like a responsibility. like, if i stay, i'm just being selfish and letting the cycle keep spinning. if i leave, i'm actually doing something good for once. i'm protecting them. doesn't it make sense that the most selfless thing would be to just stop the damage right here?",
